## Failures and how to do differently

- symptom: prompt extraction turns noisy and unreliable; cause: broad searches across session logs surface unrelated artifacts; fix: narrow to lesson-scoped docs, reviewed assets, final manifests, and current-gate/assembly-review files first [Task 1][Task 2]
- symptom: a "replicate exactly" handoff still fails to reproduce the approved look; cause: only prompt text was handed off; fix: include refs, model choice, rejected-model reason, negative constraints, and postprocess/finalizer requirements together [Task 2]
- symptom: regenerated course narration sounds oddly slow; cause: stale templates still say Andrea speed `0.95`; fix: reset to HeyGen/default speed `1.0` unless Jarrad explicitly asks for a different delivery [Task 3][ad-hoc note]
- symptom: an animation ends early and the tail looks wrong; cause: the assembly falls back to a source still or loop trick; fix: hold the clip's own extracted final frame through the remaining beat/transition duration [Task 4][ad-hoc note]

